Are the mines a side trip?

Yes.  They are intended to get your character to build up his/her
strength before he/she descends into the bowels of the dungeon.  The
end after a certain number of levels.  By the time you get out, you
should have some artifact, a blessed luckstone, a blessed bag of
holding, at _least_ seven candles, a pick axe, numerous potions of
Holy Water, a blessed Unicorn horn, and be of a respectable level.

